لا إله إلا الله رشاد رسول الله

00:016:37.000 --> 00:016:38.000
if we follow your method.

00:016:39.000 --> 00:016:50.000
Now that they picked up this opposition to me... the Muhammadans... and to the point that I'm under death sentence in a good number of countries, now.

