and Muhammad brought the Quran. And that I am the third of a triangle that I brought the proof... the proof of authenticity of the religion.

00:018:54.000 --> 00:019:01.000
The first publication... we just found out this yesterday... The first time the miracle of Quran was published

00:019:01.000 --> 00:019:05.000
was in January 1973.

00:019:06.000 --> 00:019:14.000
1973, I was 38 years old and I didn’t know anything except that I found this mathematical miracle in the Quran.

00:019:14.000 --> 00:019:26.000
And the 7th... the January 73 publication in the most popular magazine in the middle east: آخر الساعة

00:019:26.000 --> 00:019:36.000
had to do with the proportion of the initials. Qaf, for example, the letter Q in chapter 50. That chapter had the highest proportion of the letter Q.

00:019:36.000 --> 00:019:44.000
SURA Saad had the highest proportion of the letter Saad. SURA NuN had the highest proportion of SURA NuN. Alef Lam Meemm and so on.

00:019:44.000 --> 00:019:53.000
