00:019:53.000 --> 00:020:04.000
And it didn’t have the computer printouts of the whole Quran which I had written in the computer. And then in 1973, in November

00:020:04.000 --> 00:020:12.000
which is exactly my 38th birthday was the first report on the number 19. That was back in 73.

00:020:12.000 --> 00:020:22.000
And... but I didn’t know that I am God's messenger in that sense until 1980.

00:020:22.000 --> 00:020:32.000
1980 was correspondent to the year 1400, the Islamic year. And

00:020:32.000 --> 00:020:40.000
